{"id":"largo","lemma":"largo","pos":"adj","rank":489,"glosses":["long (having much distance from one terminating point to another)","long, lengthy, extended, prolonged, protracted, (having great duration)","long, long-running (seemingly lasting a lot of time)"],"ipa":"/ˈlaɾɡo/","forms":{"feminine":"larga","masculinePlural":"largos","femininePlural":"largas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/af/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodelar-largo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Mi pelo es largo.","en":"My hair is long.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/456404"},{"text":"¡Qué semana más larga!","en":"What a long week!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636991"},{"text":"No me gustan los viajes largos.","en":"I don't like long drives.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/599183"},{"text":"Él tiene piernas largas.","en":"He has long legs.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442426"},{"text":"Tiene el pelo largo.","en":"He has long hair.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/65129"}]}